[
    {
        "content": "<p>Hi all,</p>\n<p>This is the KConfig file being used on our GFXBench benchmarks, in case anybody attempts to replicate them. Thanks to <span class=\"user-mention\" data-user-id=\"532207\">@Sami Tolvanen</span> for this.</p>\n<p><a href=\"/user_uploads/35136/LLOOvrl9EDTAxCF_tcPXl7Xf/config.tyr.performance\">config.tyr.performance</a></p>",
        "id": 623161183,
        "sender_full_name": "Daniel Almeida",
        "timestamp": 1789049036
    },
    {
        "content": "<p>I get this reproduced with gl_5_normal test.<br>\nIt is not the kernel driver issue but the userspace one.<br>\n<code>261.803599] tyr: tyr fault_debug: pt_update exec map va=0x7ffeffe00000..0x7fff09600000 bo_offset=0x0 flags=0x2 prot=0xf</code><br>\n The fault address is:</p>\n<p>0x7ffeffffe400</p>\n<p>That is inside the mapped range:</p>\n<p>0x7ffeffe00000..0x7fff09600000</p>\n<p>The first fault is not a missing mapping. It is an execute permission fault while the software page table still says the page is present</p>\n<div class=\"codehilite\" data-code-language=\"Rust\"><pre><span></span><code><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"mi\">18</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"p\">[</span><span class=\"w\">  </span><span class=\"mf\">262.817963</span><span class=\"p\">]</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">tyr</span><span class=\"p\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nc\">Unhandled</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">Page</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">fault</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"k\">in</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">AS2</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">at</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">VA</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"mh\">0x00007FFEFFFFE400</span>\n<span class=\"w\">  </span><span class=\"mi\">19</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"p\">[</span><span class=\"w\">  </span><span class=\"mf\">262.817963</span><span class=\"p\">]</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">raw</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">fault</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">status</span><span class=\"p\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"mh\">0x40001CA</span>\n<span class=\"w\">  </span><span class=\"mi\">20</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"p\">[</span><span class=\"w\">  </span><span class=\"mf\">262.817963</span><span class=\"p\">]</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">decoded</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">fault</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">status</span><span class=\"p\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nc\">SLAVE</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">FAULT</span>\n<span class=\"w\">  </span><span class=\"mi\">21</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"p\">[</span><span class=\"w\">  </span><span class=\"mf\">262.817963</span><span class=\"p\">]</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">exception</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"k\">type</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"mh\">0xCA</span><span class=\"p\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nc\">PERM_FAULT_2</span>\n<span class=\"w\">  </span><span class=\"mi\">22</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"p\">[</span><span class=\"w\">  </span><span class=\"mf\">262.817963</span><span class=\"p\">]</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">access</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"k\">type</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"mh\">0x1</span><span class=\"p\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nc\">EXECUTE</span>\n<span class=\"w\">  </span><span class=\"mi\">23</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"p\">[</span><span class=\"w\">  </span><span class=\"mf\">262.817963</span><span class=\"p\">]</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">source</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">id</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"mh\">0x400</span>\n</code></pre></div>\n<p>GPU instruction fetch from a VA that is mapped as NOEXEC</p>\n<p>The later TRANSLATION_FAULT_2 entries are secondary. The same range is unmapped first</p>\n<div class=\"codehilite\" data-code-language=\"Rust\"><pre><span></span><code><span class=\"mi\">218</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"p\">[</span><span class=\"w\">  </span><span class=\"mf\">265.021044</span><span class=\"p\">]</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">tyr</span><span class=\"p\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nc\">tyr</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">fault_debug</span><span class=\"p\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nc\">vm_bind</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">exec</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"k\">async</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">unmap</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">va</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"mh\">0x7ffeffe00000</span><span class=\"o\">..</span><span class=\"mh\">0x7fff09600000</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">size</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"mh\">0x9800000</span>\n<span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"mi\">219</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"p\">[</span><span class=\"w\">  </span><span class=\"mf\">265.021936</span><span class=\"p\">]</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">tyr</span><span class=\"p\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nc\">tyr</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">fault_debug</span><span class=\"p\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nc\">vm_bind</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">apply</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">unmap</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">va</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"mh\">0x7ffeffe00000</span><span class=\"o\">..</span><span class=\"mh\">0x7fff09600000</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">size</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"mh\">0x9800000</span>\n<span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"mi\">220</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"p\">[</span><span class=\"w\">  </span><span class=\"mf\">265.022758</span><span class=\"p\">]</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">tyr</span><span class=\"p\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nc\">tyr</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">fault_debug</span><span class=\"p\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nc\">pt_update</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">exec</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">unmap</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">va</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"mh\">0x7ffeffe00000</span><span class=\"o\">..</span><span class=\"mh\">0x7fff09600000</span>\n<span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"mi\">221</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"p\">[</span><span class=\"w\">  </span><span class=\"mf\">265.023481</span><span class=\"p\">]</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">tyr</span><span class=\"p\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nc\">tyr</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">fault_debug</span><span class=\"p\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nc\">mmu</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">start_vm_update</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"k\">as</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"mi\">2</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">range</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"mh\">0x7ffeffe00000</span><span class=\"o\">..</span><span class=\"mh\">0x7fff09600000</span>\n<span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"mi\">222</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"p\">[</span><span class=\"w\">  </span><span class=\"mf\">265.024264</span><span class=\"p\">]</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">tyr</span><span class=\"p\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nc\">tyr</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">fault_debug</span><span class=\"p\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nc\">pt_update</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">begin</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">Unmap</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">range</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"mh\">0x7ffeffe00000</span><span class=\"o\">..</span><span class=\"mh\">0x7fff09600000</span>\n<span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"mi\">223</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"p\">[</span><span class=\"w\">  </span><span class=\"mf\">265.025051</span><span class=\"p\">]</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">tyr</span><span class=\"p\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nc\">tyr</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">fault_debug</span><span class=\"p\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nc\">sm_step_unmap</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">va</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"mh\">0x7ffeffe00000</span><span class=\"o\">..</span><span class=\"mh\">0x7fff09600000</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">len</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"mh\">0x9800000</span>\n<span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"mi\">224</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"p\">[</span><span class=\"w\">  </span><span class=\"mf\">265.025816</span><span class=\"p\">]</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">tyr</span><span class=\"p\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nc\">tyr</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">fault_debug</span><span class=\"p\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nc\">mmu</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">end_vm_update</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"k\">as</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"mi\">2</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">range</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"mh\">0x7ffeffe00000</span><span class=\"o\">..</span><span class=\"mh\">0x7fff09600000</span>\n<span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"mi\">225</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"p\">[</span><span class=\"w\">  </span><span class=\"mf\">265.196012</span><span class=\"p\">]</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">tyr</span><span class=\"p\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nc\">Unhandled</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">Page</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">fault</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"k\">in</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">AS2</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">at</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">VA</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"mh\">0x00007FFEFFFFE400</span>\n<span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"mi\">226</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"p\">[</span><span class=\"w\">  </span><span class=\"mf\">265.196012</span><span class=\"p\">]</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">raw</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">fault</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">status</span><span class=\"p\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"mh\">0x241001C2</span>\n<span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"mi\">227</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"p\">[</span><span class=\"w\">  </span><span class=\"mf\">265.196012</span><span class=\"p\">]</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">decoded</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">fault</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">status</span><span class=\"p\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nc\">SLAVE</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">FAULT</span>\n<span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"mi\">228</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"p\">[</span><span class=\"w\">  </span><span class=\"mf\">265.196012</span><span class=\"p\">]</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">exception</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"k\">type</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"mh\">0xC2</span><span class=\"p\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nc\">TRANSLATION_FAULT_2</span>\n<span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"mi\">229</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"p\">[</span><span class=\"w\">  </span><span class=\"mf\">265.196012</span><span class=\"p\">]</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">access</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"k\">type</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"mh\">0x1</span><span class=\"p\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nc\">EXECUTE</span>\n<span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"mi\">230</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"p\">[</span><span class=\"w\">  </span><span class=\"mf\">265.196012</span><span class=\"p\">]</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">source</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">id</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"mh\">0x2410</span>\n</code></pre></div>\n<p>I won't probably have the cycles to track what's happening on the userspace front. At least not this week.</p>",
        "id": 625686962,
        "sender_full_name": "Beata Michalska",
        "timestamp": 1789983622
    },
    {
        "content": "<p>Pretty sure that’s similar with Panthor too</p>",
        "id": 625710479,
        "sender_full_name": "Daniel Almeida",
        "timestamp": 1789990167
    },
    {
        "content": "<p>Looks like we don't hold long enough on to the shader buffers</p>",
        "id": 625776486,
        "sender_full_name": "Boris Brezillon",
        "timestamp": 1790004802
    },
    {
        "content": "<p>I assume on Panthor you'd get a TRANS_FAULT_2 directly, because of the atomicity on VM ops</p>",
        "id": 625776777,
        "sender_full_name": "Boris Brezillon",
        "timestamp": 1790004865
    },
    {
        "content": "<p>Or the shader being executed jumps outside the executable buffer</p>",
        "id": 625788240,
        "sender_full_name": "Boris Brezillon",
        "timestamp": 1790006623
    },
    {
        "content": "<p>what would be interesting to check is whether this range was previously covered by an executable mapping</p>",
        "id": 625789224,
        "sender_full_name": "Boris Brezillon",
        "timestamp": 1790006834
    },
    {
        "content": "<p>Reproduced on panthor with mesa main</p>",
        "id": 625828726,
        "sender_full_name": "Boris Brezillon",
        "timestamp": 1790016312
    },
    {
        "content": "<p>Quick updated, when you use PAN_MESA_DEBUG=nocache, it doesn't happen anymore. I've tracked it down to the CS chunk pool (I have a hack that forces nocache just on this pool), but I can't make sense of it</p>",
        "id": 625961066,
        "sender_full_name": "Boris Brezillon",
        "timestamp": 1790066658
    },
    {
        "content": "<p>Maybe that's a red herring, and the latency caused by the KMD allocation is what fixes the issue</p>",
        "id": 625961323,
        "sender_full_name": "Boris Brezillon",
        "timestamp": 1790066710
    },
    {
        "content": "<p>But when I tried adding that to other pools, it didn't solve the issue</p>",
        "id": 625961414,
        "sender_full_name": "Boris Brezillon",
        "timestamp": 1790066731
    },
    {
        "content": "<p><a href=\"https://gitlab.freedesktop.org/mesa/mesa/-/merge_requests/44629\">https://gitlab.freedesktop.org/mesa/mesa/-/merge_requests/44629</a></p>",
        "id": 626091162,
        "sender_full_name": "Boris Brezillon",
        "timestamp": 1790095633
    },
    {
        "content": "<p><span class=\"user-mention\" data-user-id=\"532207\">@Sami Tolvanen</span> <span class=\"user-mention\" data-user-id=\"582628\">@Daniel Almeida</span> <span class=\"user-mention\" data-user-id=\"878151\">@Beata Michalska</span> this fixes it for me ^</p>",
        "id": 626091241,
        "sender_full_name": "Boris Brezillon",
        "timestamp": 1790095655
    },
    {
        "content": "<p>Wasn't sure who I should flag as the reporter</p>",
        "id": 626091389,
        "sender_full_name": "Boris Brezillon",
        "timestamp": 1790095691
    },
    {
        "content": "<p>I think I was the first person to hit this, but it doesn’t matter, nice fix man</p>",
        "id": 626091778,
        "sender_full_name": "Daniel Almeida",
        "timestamp": 1790095786
    }
